      "id": "claim_c68621fd7a70434da302c6d9daca8b2f",
      "statement": "Talon loads remote async-subagent definitions from `[async_subagents.<name>]` TOML tables and supplies the loader to its `DeepAgentRuntime`; an absent file yields no definitions, while unreadable, malformed, non-table, or invalid configuration raises instead of partially loading valid entries.",
